d": 0, "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn11le03ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Have you studied the monthly sales report, Denise?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: No, how does it look?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: It would appear that your sales pitch has finally taken off. We have seen a 200% increase in sales in the financial literacy workbooks since last month.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Excellent!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: This is more good news. The marketing department has informed me that the number of requests for presentations has increased dramatically. There is also a message from a local bank president who has expressed an interest in becoming a corporate sponsor.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: That's great news.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le03ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "33500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: You know, it would be a good idea to evaluate our strategies. What worked well? What didn't work very well? What changes to the pitch or other factors made a difference?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Yes. That's a good idea, because talking about it now will help me give feedback at the next board meeting.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: From my perspective, I think we have had more success through the direct marketing approach. We were more successful when we contacted the end users -- the parents or teachers -- not the bureaucrats in the school board or the Department of Education.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le03ob07re2img06.jpg"}, {"time": "66500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: I agree. We've also have been more successful since I worked on the pitch. I geared it towards the specific needs of the consumer, rather than to our own track record. People became enthusiastic because I was able to summarize their problems even before they had the chance to express them.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: We explained \u201cthe fit\u201d.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Right. It seems our investment in focus groups has helped a lot to understand the market.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>:  Although direct marketing is powerful, don't forget that we combined that with our online campaign including podcasts and using social media. Our Twitter feed is a lot more active than before, because people are asking questions and engaging in conversation directly with the authors.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le03ob07re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le03ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le03ob07re2img05.jpg"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": []}]}]}